    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ハワイのコーディネーター安く雇えたからよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I managed to hire a coordinator in Hawaii for cheap.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "女優の出演も交渉してくれるらしいぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Apparently he'll negotiate the actress's appearance for us too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "本当か。メジャーな作品にしないとな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really? Then we have to make it a major production.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "出どころは聞かないでください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please don't ask where the money came from.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "川田さん、ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you very much, Mr. Kawada.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "わがままを聞くのは今回で最後ですから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the last time I indulge your selfishness.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おい、お前ら遊びに行くんじゃねえからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hey, you guys aren't going over there to play around.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "つまんねえの撮ったら許さねえからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you shoot something boring, I won't forgive you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ああ、任せとけ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah, leave it to me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "村西さん、くれぐれもよろしくお願いします。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr. Muranishi, please take every care with this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい、いってきます。行くぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, off I go. Let's move!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "お前ら、一発逆転ホームラン頼んだぞ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm counting on you guys for a comeback home run!'",
      "gap": 0.65
